y_conn_set_children_dentry_flags() only after dropping the spinlock, so it does not walk the children under a spinlock. Stale PARENT_WATCHED flags left behind when watching stops are cleared lazily in __fsnotify_parent(), which avoids the softlockup caused by eagerly walking very large child lists.\"\n}\n"}}}
